WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.880
The sun

00:05.090 --> 00:09.930
It burns the night

00:10.680 --> 00:13.140
Defining lines between the victims

00:13.430 --> 00:15.980
And what will soon become the prey

00:15.980 --> 00:18.190
I've giving up on counting blessings

00:18.190 --> 00:20.060
The gods can judge me when I'm dead

00:20.060 --> 00:22.400
'Cause I cannot take this anymore

00:22.400 --> 00:26.030
I'm done with the feelings that I've known in paradox

00:26.740 --> 00:28.570
Lost in paradox

00:29.910 --> 00:32.370
The feeling of hatred burns my soul

00:32.370 --> 00:36.080
I'm done with the feelings that I've known in paradox

00:36.700 --> 00:38.410
Lost in paradox

00:38.870 --> 00:43.710
I'm maybe crazy enough to break myself inside my head

00:43.710 --> 00:48.550
'Cause lately I couldn't find these answers to live by instead

00:48.760 --> 00:51.140
Some will call it giving up

00:51.140 --> 00:56.430
I just call it getting lost in my own revenge

00:57.810 --> 01:02.480
I'm maybe crazy enough to break myself inside my head

01:02.480 --> 01:07.570
'Cause lately I couldn't find these answers to live by instead

01:07.570 --> 01:09.990
Some will call it giving up

01:09.990 --> 01:15.240
I just call it getting lost in my own revenge

01:15.910 --> 01:21.330
Burning out and fading away

03:54.150 --> 04:00.070
Home

03:54.150 --> 04:00.070
Home

24:10.070 --> 24:13.870
Somewhere in the distance

24:14.450 --> 24:16.460
{ED shift}

24:14.450 --> 24:18.920
I hear joy in a song I'll never know

24:21.290 --> 24:24.920
This curse, I can't take it

24:25.550 --> 24:30.010
I pray for the dying everglow{EVERGLOW IS NOT A WORD REEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE}

24:30.760 --> 24:35.930
You know I can't wither away

24:35.930 --> 24:41.020
Over the shadows, deliverance awaits

24:41.440 --> 24:48.070
Time is still racing like a river day by day

24:49.700 --> 24:55.040
Forge through the darkness

24:55.370 --> 25:00.500
Towards a limitless world

25:00.920 --> 25:06.300
Just trying to find a place where I belong

25:06.300 --> 25:09.090
I know it's somewhere out there

25:09.090 --> 25:10.470
Our heaven

25:10.470 --> 25:17.560
The flame within will burn forever

25:13.720 --> 25:19.100
There is no gloom, not here{waiting for jp lyrics to finalize}

25:18.890 --> 25:27.820
In unforgiving darkness, just count the stars

25:24.940 --> 25:30.240
Hold up the guiding light

25:29.990 --> 25:33.570
Be torn towards distant lands

25:33.950 --> 25:36.950
Live the moment
